            "ipa": "",
            "meaning": "竞争对手",
            "level": "red",
            "isSelfAnnotated": true
          }
        ],
        "selfAnnotated": true
      },
      {
        "key": "B",
        "text": "was unpopular among European royals.",
        "isCorrect": false,
        "distractorType": "UNFOUNDED",
        "analysis": "无中生有。文中仅提及西班牙王室危机引发了所有欧洲王室的集体拷问，未提及卡洛斯在欧洲其他王室同僚中是否受欢迎。",
