    "stem": "Which of the following is shown to be odd, according to Paragraph 4?",
    "stemTranslation": null,
    "options": [
      {
        "key": "A",
        "text": "Aristocrats' excessive reliance on inherited wealth.",
        "isCorrect": false,
        "distractorType": "ATTRIBUTION_ERROR",
        "analysis": "张冠李戴。第四段第三句提及托马斯·皮凯蒂等经济学家就世袭财富的权力增长发出警告，这是宏观经济学家的专业预警背景，并非作者指出感到‘奇怪古怪（odd/bizarre）’的事情本身。",
        "vocab": [
          {
            "word": "excessive",
