    "stemTranslation": null,
    "options": [
      {
        "key": "A",
        "text": "takes a tough line on political issues.",
        "isCorrect": false,
        "distractorType": "UNFOUNDED",
        "analysis": "无中生有。文中批判查尔斯未能理解君主应扮演‘非政治（non-political）’角色，但并未指明他在政治问题上采取强硬强权路线（tough line）。",
